Z||000000||BAM-BAM||04-01-2000||10:03 PM||||   Just found out that a CD Player from an 97<BR>Grand Prix works in my 85GT. Fit right in; only thing is that I have to get adapters for the plugs.They changed the plugs sometime<BR>in the early 90's. Man, it looks great, just like it was made for the Fiero. That and my Cobra head shift knob(automatic)from an 95 Grand Prix; now all I need is the rest of the dash  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> It will look even better once I put the Billet Panels in.<P> Be Cool! BAM OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 04-02-2000).]||||reg||6
